# Changelog pipeline: batch folders are tracked in full. input.json looks
# regenerable but is not — collect resolves page titles and URLs at HEAD, so a
# later re-run produces different content and breaks the cross-check that keeps a
# hallucinated PR off a customer-facing page. render.js also requires it.
